<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Moody's affirms AAA RAMS mortage bond rating.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Moody's affirms AAA RAMS mortage bond rating.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service on Thursday confirmed the Aaa rating assigned to the Series 2 Class A Bonds issued by RAMS Mortgage Corporation Limited following the issuance of an additional A$190 million of Class A Bonds out of RMC Series 2.</p>
<p>With this additional issuance, the total amount of Series 2 Class A Bonds increased to A$570 million from A$380 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
